a ir iekļauta produktu reģistra kartē"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett tad-data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tar-Reġistru tal-Prodotti"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Register map"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie produktu"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa do registo do produto"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta registrului produsului"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou mapy registra výrobkov."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v zemljevid registra proizvodov."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в карту реєстрації продукції"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/3b9fc721-e167-4c11-b611-a495fb590506"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/51700df8-a7f8-4d7c-bf56-ec81d4514b30","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/3b9fc721-e167-4c11-b611-a495fb590506"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"51700df8-a7f8-4d7c-bf56-ec81d4514b30","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:07Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:46:03Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/51700df8-a7f8-4d7c-bf56-ec81d4514b30"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:012116dfef284c51128b9f75feebf1925519a11126268e9ff5c124766a61debe_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/51700df8-a7f8-4d7c-bf56-ec81d4514b30"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-07T11:15:06Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:46:0