-mtec","@value":"Il set di dati è incluso nella mappa del registro del prodotto"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Duomenų rinkinys įtrauktas į produktų registro žemėlapį"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datu kopa ir iekļauta produktu reģistra kartē"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett tad-data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tar-Reġistru tal-Prodotti"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Register map"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie produktu"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa do registo do produto"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta registrului produsului"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou mapy registra výrobkov."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v zemljevid registra proizvodov."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в карту реєстрації продукції"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/eea03b11-29f6-450a-a859-658373508287"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/16fa6998-8dbb-4c3f-a7cc-bfac23f63a03","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/eea03b11-29f6-450a-a859-658373508287"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"16fa6998-8dbb-4c3f-a7cc-bfac23f63a03","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:05Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:45:14Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/16fa6998-8dbb-4c3f-a7cc-bfac23f63a03"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:41f20cdc19739431ce77670aa80635920d9805114636edd0816c04b0015a70b6_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/16fa6998-8dbb-4c3f-a7cc-bfac23f63a03"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#