lities informationen (FeatureType)","dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:title":"TK Open data WMS tjänst"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Trafikkontoret/","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad - Trafikkontoret"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:funktionsbrevlada.tk.open.data@stockholm.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:4425393eae4d343588f84095b20e6bcf892a44c04291e69ed2464862f05ebef4"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:45f642248886a39e09aed94592861ca7af15f0659957265d36464ac600d2f1fc_b0n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"1a708335a3f42705f21ce686894cf8c93a"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/923424fb-f37a-4914-bdf7-bf52e686a45f","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholm+Vatten+och+Avfall/"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/10c10d2a-7868-46ed-a05b-b47a8ad2f149"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/189f55dc-9e79-40b3-ae8b-bf1d550fe340"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/9c0a310b-7c54-4f9c-8372-6a410037e1a2"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/f7355a92-ae87-4383-960a-cd8060661636"}],"dcat:keyword":["Stockholm Vatten och Avfall",{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=79acc8eb-2649-4650-bd73-a9d9c36baa12"},"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Стопанска област на Стокхолм за вода и отпадъци съответно за вода и отпадни води и дъждовни води. Актуализира се, когато се правят промени, обикновено всяка година."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Obchodní oblast Stockholm Water a Waste pro vodu a odpadní vody a dešťové vody. Aktualizovány při provádění změn, obvykle každý rok."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Wastes forretningsområde for henholdsvis vand og spildevand og regnvand. Opdateres, når der foretages ændringer, normalt hvert år."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Waste ist der Geschäftsbereich für Wasser und Abwasser bzw. für Regenwasser. Aktualisiert, wenn Änderungen vorgenommen werden, normalerweise jedes Jahr."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Τομέας Υδάτων και Αποβλήτων της Στοκχόλμης για τα ύδατα και τα λύματα και τα όμβρια ύδατα αντίστοιχα. Επικαιροποιείται όταν γίνονται αλλαγές, συνήθως κάθε χρόνο."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Waste's business area for water and wastewater and stormwater respectively. Updated when changes are made, normally every year."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Área de negocio de Agua y Residuos de Estocolmo para agua y aguas residuales y pluviales respectivamente. Actualizado cuando se realizan cambios, normalmente cada año."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholmi vee ja jäätmete ärivaldkond vastavalt vee, reovee ja sademevee valdkonnas. Uuendatakse muudatuste tegemise ajal, tavaliselt igal aastal."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Waterin ja Wasten vesi- ja jätevesiliiketoiminta-alue sekä hulevesiliiketoiminta-alue. Päivitetään, kun muutoksia tehdään, yleensä joka vuosi."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Domaine d'activité de Stockholm Water and Waste pour l'eau et les eaux usées et les eaux pluviales respectivement. Mise à jour lorsque des modifications sont apportées, normalement chaque année."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Limistéar gnó Uisce agus Dramhaíola Stócólm maidir le huisce agus fuíolluisce agus uisce stoirme faoi seach. Nuashonraithe nuair a dhéantar athruithe, de ghnáth gach bliain."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Poslovno područje Stockholm Water i Waste za vodu i otpadne vode i oborinske vode. Ažurira se kada dođe do promjena, obično svake godine."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A stockholmi Víz és Hulladék üzletág a víz, a szennyvíz és a csapadékvíz tekintetében. Frissítve, ha változások történnek, általában évente."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water e Waste's business area rispettivamente per l'acqua e le acque reflue e le acque piovane. Aggiornato quando vengono apportate modifiche, normalmente ogni anno."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stokholmo vandens ir atliekų verslo zona, skirta atitinkamai vandeniui ir nuotekoms bei paviršinėms nuotekoms. Atnaujinama, kai daromi pakeitimai, paprastai kiekvienais metais."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Waste uzņēmējdarbības joma attiecīgi ūdenim un notekūdeņiem un lietusūdeņiem. Atjaunināts, kad tiek veiktas izmaiņas, parasti katru gadu."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Iż-żona tan-negozju tal-Ilma u l-Iskart ta' Stokkolma għall-ilma u l-ilma mormi u l-ilma tal-maltemp rispettivament. Aġġornat meta jsiru l-bidliet, normalment kull sena."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Waste's business area voor respectievelijk water en afvalwater en regenwater. Bijgewerkt wanneer wijzigingen worden aangebracht, normaal gesproken elk jaar."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Obszar biznesowy Stockholm Water and Waste odpowiednio dla wody i ścieków oraz wód opadowych. Aktualizowane, gdy wprowadzane są zmiany, zwykle co roku."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Área de negócio da Stockholm Water and Waste para água e águas residuais e águas pluviais, respetivamente. Atualizado quando as alterações são feitas, normalmente todos os anos."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Domeniul de activitate al Stockholm Water and Waste pentru apă și ape uzate și, respectiv, ape pluviale. Actualizat atunci când se fac modificări, în mod normal în fiecare an."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Stockholm Water and Waste je obchodná oblasť pre vodu, odpadovú vodu a dažďovú vodu. Aktualizované po vykonaní zmien, zvyčajne každý rok."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Poslovno področje Stockholm Water in Waste za vodo in odpadno vodo oziroma meteorne vode. Posodobljeno ob spremembah, običajno vsako leto."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholm Vatten och Avfalls verksamhetsområde för vatten- och spillvatten respektive dagvatten. Uppdateras när förändringar görs, normalt varje år."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ділова зона Stockholm Water and Waste для води та стічних вод та зливових вод відповідно. Оновлюється, коли вносяться зміни, як правило, щороку."}],"dct:format":["application/vnd.ogc.wfs_xml","application/vnd.ogc.wms_xml","text/html"],"dct:identifier":"923424fb-f37a-4914-bdf7-bf52e686a45f","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/otherlicense"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-02-22"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#foaf/Stockholm+Vatten+och+Avfall/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Област на дейност — свободно достъпни данни"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oblast činnosti – veřejně přístupná data"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aktivitetsområde - Åbne data"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tätigkeitsbereich - Offene Daten"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Τομέας δραστηριότητας - Ανοικτά δεδομένα"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Area of activity - Open data"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Área de actividad - Datos abiertos"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tegevusvaldkond – avatud andmed"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Toiminta-ala - Avoin data"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Domaine d'activité - Données ouvertes"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Réimse gníomhaíochta - Sonraí oscailte"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Područje djelovanja – otvoreni podaci"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tevékenységi terület – Nyílt hozzáférésű adatok"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Settore di attività - Open data"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Veiklos sritis – atvirieji duomenys"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Darbības joma – atvērtie dati"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Qasam ta' attività - Data miftuħa"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Werkterrein - Open data"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Obszar działalności - Otwarte dane"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Domínio de atividade - Dados abertos"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Domeniul de activitate - Date deschise"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Oblasť činnosti – otvorené údaje"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Področje dejavnosti – odprti podatki"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verksamhetsområde - Öppna data"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Сфера діяльності - Відкриті дані"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/10c10d2a-7868-46ed-a05b-b47a8ad2f149","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://geodata-svoa-extern.stockholm.se/Geodata/arcgis/services/Verksamhetsomraden/Verksamhetsomraden/MapServer/WMSServer"},"dct:d