"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/cd7c6ea6-feb7-4bb6-a616-25e2f980ec2f#HTTP:Nedladdning:data/3","dct:title":["Testdata DWG-format",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Формат на DWG за данните от изпитванията"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zkušební data ve formátu DWG"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Prøvningsdata i DWG-format"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testdaten DWG-Format"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Μορφότυπος δεδομένων δοκιμής DWG"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Test data DWG format"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formato DWG de los datos de prueba"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Katseandmed DWG formaat"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testitiedot DWG-muodossa"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Format DWG des données d'essai"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formáid DWG sonraí tástála"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"DWG format podataka o ispitivanju"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Vizsgálati adatok DWG formátuma"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dati di prova in formato DWG"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"DWG formato bandymų duomenys"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testa datu DWG formāts"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il-format tad-DWG tad-data tat-test"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testgegevens DWG-formaat"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dane testowe w formacie DWG"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formato DWG dos dados de ensaio"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formatul DWG al datelor de încercare"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skúšobné údaje vo formáte DWG"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Preskusni podatki v obliki DWG"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Перевірка даних у форматі DWG"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/f1877344-5e