espetsifikaat"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tuote-eritelmä"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Spécification du produit"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Sonraíocht táirge"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Specifikacija proizvoda"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Termékleírás"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Specifiche del prodotto"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Produkto specifikacija"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Produkta specifikācija"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Speċifikazzjoni tal-prodott"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Productspecificatie"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Specyfikacja produktu"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Caderno de especificações"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Caietul de sarcini al produsului"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Špecifikácia výrobku"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Specifikacija izdelka"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Специфікація продукту"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/11a889af-6a83-4939-be5b-4404b7d3d36a"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/74ae072e-007b-4576-bba8-d663f0c9f486","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/Data/Stadsbyggnadskontoret/Baskarta_DWG.dgn"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/f9710b3f-401b-4c88-8138-2cd57408b104#HTTP:Nedladdning:data/3","dct:title":["Testdata DWG-format",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Формат на DWG за данните от изпитванията"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zkušební data ve formátu DWG"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Prøvningsdata i DWG-format"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testdaten DWG-Format"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Μορφότυπος δεδομένων δοκιμής DWG"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Test data DWG format"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formato DWG de los datos de prueba"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Katseandmed DWG formaat"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testitiedot DWG-muodossa"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Format DWG des données d'essai"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formáid DWG sonraí tástála"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"DWG format podataka o ispitivanju"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Vizsgálati adatok DWG formátuma"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dati di prova in formato DWG"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"DWG formato bandymų duomenys"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testa datu DWG formāts"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il-format tad-DWG tad-data tat-test"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Testgegevens DWG-formaat"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dane testowe w formacie DWG"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formato DWG dos dados de ensaio"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Formatul DWG al datelor de încercare"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skúšobné údaje vo formáte DWG"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Preskusni podatki v obliki DWG"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Перевірка даних у форматі DWG"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/74ae072e-007b-4576-bba8-d663f0c9f486"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/e446aa22-110f-474f-9e51-83bfe919f1fc","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://kartor.stockholm/kartor-geodata/"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/f9710b3f-401b-4c88-8138-2cd57408b104#HTTP:Information/1","dct:title":["Beställ kartor och geodata",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Карти на поръчките и геоданни"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Objednat mapy a geodata"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Bestil kort og geodata"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Karten und Geodaten bestellen"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Παραγγελία χαρτών και γεωδεδομένων"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Order maps and geodata"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapas de pedidos y geodatos"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Telli kaardid ja geoandmed"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tilaa karttoja ja paikkatietoja"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Commander des cartes et des géodonnées"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Léarscáileanna ordaithe agus geoshonraí"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Karte narudžbi i geopodaci"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Térképek és geodaták rendelése"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Ordina mappe e geodati"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Užsakymo žemėlapiai ir geoduomenys"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Pasūtījumu kartes un ģeodati"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Mapep tal-ordnijiet u ġeodata"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kaarten en geodata bestellen"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zamów mapy i geodane"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Encomendar mapas e dados geográficos"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Comandă hărți și geodate"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Objednať mapy a geoúdaje"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zemljevidi naročil in geopodatki"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Замовити карти і геодані"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/e446aa22-110f-474f-9e51-83bfe919f1fc"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/f9710b3f-401b-4c88-8138-2cd57408b104","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/11a889af-6a83-4939-be5b-4404b7d3d36a"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/74ae072e-007b-4576-bba8-d663f0c9f486"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/e446aa22-110f-474f-9e51-