tensatz ist in der Produktliste enthalten."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Το σύνολο δεδομένων περιλαμβάνεται στον χάρτη μητρώου προϊόντων"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"The data set is included in the product Register map"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"El conjunto de datos se incluye en el mapa de registro del producto"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Andmekogum on lisatud tooteregistri kaardile"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aineisto sisältyy tuoterekisterikarttaan"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'ensemble de données est inclus dans la carte du registre des produits"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tá an tacar sonraí san áireamh ar léarscáil an Chláir táirgí"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skup podataka uključen je u kartu registra proizvoda"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az adatkészlet szerepel a terméknyilvántartás térképén"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il set di dati è incluso nella mappa del registro del prodotto"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Duomenų rinkinys įtrauktas į produktų registro žemėlapį"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datu kopa ir iekļauta produktu reģistra kartē"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett tad-data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tar-Reġistru tal-Prodotti"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De dataset is opgenomen in het product Register map"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie produktu"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa do registo do produto"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta registrului produsului"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Súbor údajov je súčasťou mapy registra výrobkov."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v zemljevid registra proizvodov."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних включений в карту реєстрації продукції"}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/2262c03b-3858-4a1f-bf0a-a6d7de41a36a"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445","@type":"dcat:CatalogRecord","dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/2262c03b-3858-4a1f-bf0a-a6d7de41a36a"},"dct:creator":{"@id":"http://piveau.io"},"dct:identifier":"f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-03-20T11:15:07Z"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:45:28Z"},"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksum":{"@id":"_:dfc4033c547697b3c2bf0e2ec3cc67991ccb21ad9b6ee39aea2f2b644e5385ba_b1n0"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#hasQualityMetadata":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/metrics/f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#originalLanguage":"sv","https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transIssued":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-06-07T11:15:05Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transReceived":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"2026-07-03T08:45:28Z"},"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#transStatus":{"@id":"https://europeandataportal.eu/voc#TransCompleted"},"https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalId":"f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445","https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#originalURIRef":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/f78e6a77-dc75-48dc-8dfd-449df8609445"},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000142","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:kommunstyrelsen@stockholm.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.stockholm.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#foaf/Stockholms+stad/"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stadsbyggnadskontoret+-+Stadsm%C3%A4tningsavdelningen+-+Geodatadistributionsenheten/","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stadsbyggnadskontoret - Stadsmätningsavdelningen - Geodatadistributionsenheten"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:geodataservice@stockholm.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:dfc4033c547697b3c2bf0e2ec3cc67991ccb21ad9b6ee39aea2f2b644e5385ba"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:e065309e1a926061dbaa98eae47c1664d3282fba63459c17d4cb065a414ac6f0_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120000142","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:kommunstyrelsen@stockholm.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.stockholm.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#foaf/Stockholms+stad/"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Trafikkontoret/"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Information/1"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Nedladdning/2"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Nedladdning/3"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:OGC:WFS/4"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:OGC:WMS/5"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ingen eller försumbar skada"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"NVDB"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=LvFeature4000037"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/5850"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geometri som representerar data om ett permanent fysiskt hinder med syfte att hindra obehörig fordonspassage på vägsträcka. Företeelsetypen innehåller uppgifter om typ av hinder som pollare, eftergivlig grind, ej öppningsbar grind eller cykelfålla, låst grind eller bom, betonghinder eller övrigt hinder. Tillhör verksamhet NVDB (Trafikverket). Utbredning: Stockholms län"},"dct:identifier":"6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2012-03-09"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-04"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:e065309e1a926061dbaa98eae47c1664d3282fba63459c17d4cb065a414ac6f0_b0n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"NVDB - Väghinder"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Information/1","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://openstreetws.stockholm.se"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:title":"Webbsida med handledning och API-beskrivning"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Nedladdning/2","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://openstreetws.stockholm.se/LvWS-2.2/Lv.asmx"},"dct:description":"Beskrivning av LvWS APIs olika metoder.","dct:title":"Tjänsteadress web service"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:Nedladdning/3","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://openstreetgs.stockholm.se/geoservice/api/DIN+API-NYCKEL/wfs/?version=1.0.0&request=GetFeature&typeName=od_gis:NVDB_Vaghinder&outputFormat=GeoPackage"},"dct:description":"Export via WFS och GeoService returnerar en GeoPackage","dct:title":"TK Open data GeoPackage export"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:OGC:WFS/4","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://openstreetgs.stockholm.se/geoservice/api/DIN+API-NYCKEL/wfs?typename=od_gis:NVDB_Vaghinder"},"dct:description":"OGC Web Feature Service 1.0.0 och 1.1.0. Gällande featuretype hittas i capabilities informationen (FeatureType)","dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WFS_SRVC"},"dct:title":"TK Open data WFS tjänst","http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/6bf0062f-a281-4f5e-8197-576b849f3b53#HTTP:OGC:WMS/5","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://openstreetgs.stockholm.se/geoservice/api/DIN+API-NYCKEL/wms?layers=od_gis:NVDB_Vaghinder"},"dct:description":"OGC Web Map Service 1.1.1 och 1.3.0. Gällande featuretype hittas i capabilities informationen (FeatureType)","dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:title":"TK Open data WMS tjänst"},{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stockholms+stad+-+Trafikkontoret/","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stockholms stad - Trafikkontoret"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:funktionsbrevlada.tk.open.data@stockholm.se"}}],"@id":"urn:source:e065309e1a926061dbaa98eae47c1664d3282fba63459c17d4cb065a414ac6f0"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:e0f71eb48e33e1431d93e64f5f5bdcda05ec2c1935ac40c75e9d0d2410148b70_b0n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#geometry":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((17.7605 59.4402,18.2011 59.4402,18.2011 59.2272,17.7605 59.2272,17.7605 59.4402))"}},{"@id":"_:e0f71eb48e33e1431d93e64f5f5bdcda05ec2c1935ac40c75e9d0d2410148b70_b1n0","@type":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#Checksum","http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#algorithm":{"@id":"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5"},"http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumValue":"11e61dbef58b80da688ef263673a147971"},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/dataset/faaeed4f-4f38-43c9-b892-0a1642152e68","@type":["dcat:Dataset","dcat:dataset"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://resources.stockholm.se/metadata#vcard/Stadsbyggnadskontoret+-+Stadsm%C3%A4tningsavdelningen+-+Geodatadistributionsenheten/"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/fadd3137-e3e6-4501-84fc-c1dc62a55a9b"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"Extern dataportal"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fullständiga metadata"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/GetMetaDataById?id=9501aeac-7315-4eb4-acb3-3baf48323b79"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/RESTRICTED"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:created":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1992-01-01"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Колонията се състои от следните обекти и подтипове (за текущия списък вижте Обща продуктова спецификация Базова карта): Партида от колонии: 10, колония Лот. Зона на колонията: 10, районът на колонията."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonie se skládá z následujících objektů a podtypů (aktuální seznam viz Základní mapa obecných specifikací produktu): Koloniální partie: 10, kolonie Lot. Oblast kolonie: 10, koloniální oblast."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonien består af følgende objekt- og undertyper (se basiskort over generelle produktspecifikationer for den aktuelle liste): Koloniparti: 10 kolonien Lot. Koloniområde: 10, Koloniområde."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonie besteht aus den folgenden Objekten und Subtypen (für die aktuelle Liste siehe Allgemeine Produktspezifikation Basiskarte): Kolonie-Los: 10, Kolonie Lot. Koloniegebiet: 10, Koloniegebiet."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Η αποικία αποτελείται από το ακόλουθο αντικείμενο και τους ακόλουθους υποτύπους (για τον τρέχοντα κατάλογο, βλ. χάρτη βάσης γενικών προδιαγραφών προϊόντος): Παρτίδα αποικιών: 10, Αποικία Λωτ. Περιοχή αποικιών: 10, περιοχή αποικίας."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colony consists of the following object and subtypes (for the current list see General Product Specification Base Map): Colony lot: 10, Colony Lot. Colony area: 10, Colony area."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colony consta de los siguientes objetos y subtipos (para la lista actual, consulte el Mapa base de especificaciones generales del producto): Lote de colonias: 10, lote de colonias. Área de la colonia: 10, zona de colonias."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koloonia koosneb järgmistest objektidest ja alatüüpidest (praeguse loetelu kohta vt üldise tootespetsifikaadi aluskaart): Kolooniapartii: 10, koloonia Lot. Koloonia piirkond: 10, koloonia piirkond."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colony koostuu seuraavista objektista ja alatyypeistä (nykyisestä luettelosta katso yleinen tuote-eritelmän peruskartta): Siirtokunta-alue: 10, Colony Lot. Siirtokunta-alue: 10, siirtokunta-alue."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colony se compose des objets et sous-types suivants (pour la liste actuelle, voir la carte de base des spécifications générales du produit): Lot de la colonie: 10, Colony Lot. Zone de la colonie: 10, zone de la colonie."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is éard atá i gcoilíneacht an réad agus na fochineálacha seo a leanas (le haghaidh an liosta reatha féach Bunléarscáil Sonraíochta Táirge Ginearálta): Baisc choilíneachta: 10, Colony Lot. Limistéar coilíneachta: 10, limistéar Coilíneachta."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonija se sastoji od sljedećih objekata i podvrsta (za trenutačni popis vidjeti Osnovnu kartu opće specifikacije proizvoda): Serija kolonija: 10, Kolonija Lot. Područje kolonije: 10, područje Kolonije."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A kolónia a következő objektumokból és altípusokból áll (az aktuális lista az Általános Termékleírási Alaptérképben található): Telep: 10, Lot kolónia. Telepterület: 10, Kolónia területe."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colony è costituito dai seguenti oggetti e sottotipi (per l'elenco corrente vedere General Product Specification Base Map): Lotto di colonie: 10, Lotto della colonia. Zona della colonia: 10, zona colonia."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Koloniją sudaro šie objektai ir potipiai (dabartinį sąrašą žr. Bendrosios produkto specifikacijos baziniame žemėlapyje): Kolonijų partija: 10, Kolonija Lotas. Kolonijų teritorija: 10, Kolonijų sritis."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonija sastāv no šādiem objektiem un apakštipiem (pašreizējo sarakstu sk. Vispārējā produkta specifikācijas bāzes kartē): Kolonijas partija: 10, kolonijas daļa. Kolonijas apgabals: 10, kolonijas apgabals."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il-kolonja tikkonsisti mill-oġġett u s-sottotipi li ġejjin (għal-lista attwali ara l-Mappa Bażi tal-Ispeċifikazzjoni Ġenerali tal-Prodott): Lott tal-kolonji: 10, Colony Lot. Żona ta' kolonja: 10, żona tal-kolonja."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonie bestaat uit de volgende objecten en subtypen (zie voor de huidige lijst de basiskaart van de algemene productspecificatie): Koloniale partij: 10, Kolonie Lot. Koloniegebied: 10, Koloniegebied."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonia składa się z następujących obiektów i podtypów (aktualna lista znajduje się w mapie podstawowej specyfikacji produktu): Partia kolonii: 10, część kolonii. Obszar kolonii: 10, obszar kolonii."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"A colónia consiste nos seguintes objetos e subtipos (para a lista atual, ver o mapa de base das especificações gerais do produto): Lote da colónia: 10, Colónia Lot. Zona da colónia: 10, área da colónia."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Colonia este formată din următoarele obiecte și subtipuri (pentru lista actuală, a se vedea Harta de bază a caietului de sarcini general al produsului): Lotul coloniei: 10, colonia Lot. Zona coloniei: 10, zona coloniei."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolónia pozostáva z nasledujúceho objektu a podtypov (pre aktuálny zoznam pozri základnú mapu všeobecných špecifikácií produktu): Kolóniová dávka: 10, Kolónia Lot. Oblasť kolónie: 10, oblasť kolónie."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Kolonija je sestavljena iz naslednjih predmetov in podtipov (za trenutni seznam glej osnovni zemljevid splošnih specifikacij proizvoda): Kolonijska serija: 10, Kolonija Lot. Območje kolonije: 10, območje kolonije."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Koloni består av följande objekt- och subtyper (för aktuell lista se Allmän produktspecifikation Baskartan): Kolonilott: 10, Kolonilott. Koloniområde: 10, Koloniområde."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Колонія складається з наступних об'єктів і підтипів (для поточного списку див. Колонія Лот: 10, Колонія Лот. Територія колонії: 10, Колоніальний район."}],"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"faaeed4f-4f38-43c9-b892-0a1642152e68","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"1992-01-01"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/licensecategories/otherlicense"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-10-26"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120000142"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:e0f71eb48e33e1431d93e64f5f5bdcda05ec2c1935ac40c75e9d0d2410148b70_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"СБК Баскарта - колония"},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - kolonie"},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta-kolonien"},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Kolonie"},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Μπασκάρτα - Αποικία"},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colony"},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colonia"},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - koloonia"},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - siirtomaa"},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colonie"},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Coilíneacht"},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baškarta - kolonija"},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Kolónia"},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colonia"},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - kolonija"},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Kolonija"},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colony"},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta-kolonie"},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - kolonia"},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colónia"},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Colonie"},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"SBK Baskarta - kolónia"},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Besedilo pesmi Colony - SBK Baskarta"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"SBK Baskarta - Koloni"},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"СБК Баскарта - Колонія"}],"dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResourceType/dataset"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/fadd3137-e3e6-4501-84fc-c1dc62a55a9b","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://dataportalen.stockholm.se/dataportalen/?query=748573062_Dataportalen_EnkelVy_resultset&loc=sv&SplashScreen=no"},"dct:format":"text/html","dct:identifier":"https://resources.stockholm.se/data/faaeed4f-4f38-43c9-b892-0a1642152e68#HTTP:Information/1","dct:title":["Datamängden ingår i produkten Baskarta (1:400  - 1:2000).",{"@language":"bg-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Наборът от данни е включен в продуктовата базова карта (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"cs-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datový soubor je součástí produktové Základní mapy (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"da-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datasættet er inkluderet i produktbasen (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"de-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Der Datensatz ist im Produkt Basiskarte (1:400 - 1:2000) enthalten."},{"@language":"el-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Το σύνολο δεδομένων περιλαμβάνεται στον χάρτη βάσης προϊόντος (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"en-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"The data set is included in the product Base map (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"es-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"El conjunto de datos se incluye en el mapa base del producto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"et-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Andmekogum sisaldub toote aluskaardil (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"fi-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Aineisto sisältyy tuotteen peruskarttaan (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"fr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"L'ensemble de données est inclus dans la carte de base du produit (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"ga-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Tá an tacar sonraí san áireamh sa bhunléarscáil táirge (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"hr-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Skup podataka uključen je u kartu proizvoda Baza (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"hu-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Az adatkészlet megtalálható a termék alaptérképén (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"it-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Il set di dati è incluso nella mappa di base del prodotto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"lt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Duomenų rinkinys įtrauktas į gaminio bazinį žemėlapį (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"lv-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Datu kopa ir iekļauta produktu bāzes kartē (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"mt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Is-sett tad-data huwa inkluż fil-mappa tal-bażi tal-prodott (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"nl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"De gegevensset is opgenomen in de productbasiskaart (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Zbiór danych znajduje się na mapie bazowej produktu (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"pt-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"O conjunto de dados está incluído no mapa de base do produto (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"ro-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Setul de date este inclus în harta de bază a produsului (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Dátový súbor je súčasťou produktu Základná mapa (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"sl-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Nabor podatkov je vključen v osnovni zemljevid izdelka (1:400 - 1:2000)."},{"@language":"uk-t-sv-t0-mtec","@value":"Набір даних входить до базової карти продукту (1:400 - 1:2000)."}],"foaf:primaryTopic":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/distribution/fadd3137-e3e6-4501-84fc-c1dc62a55a9b"}},{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/88u/record/